    'content' => '<div>
     <p>The PHP team is pleased to announce a new beta release of PHP 8.6.0, Beta 2. This continues the PHP 8.6 release cycle, the rough outline of which is specified in the <a href="https://wiki.php.net/todo/php86">PHP Wiki</a>.</p>
