       </p>
       <p>
         The next release will be Beta 4, planned for 29 August 2024.
       </p>
       <p>
         The signatures for the release can be found in
         <a href="https://gist.github.com/NattyNarwhal/fdd2de9d3b165143d376679258811c15">the manifest</a>
         or on <a href="https://qa.php.net/">the QA site</a>.
       </p>
