     <p>Don\'t miss the seventh episode of one of the most outstanding PHP and web development conferences in Europe from <b>Nov 4 to 6, 2020</b> in the stunning atmosphere of Germany\'s largest football stadium in <b>Dortmund</b>, which is world famous for its legendary "yellow wall".</p>
