     Nov 5 - Conference day 1 + networking evening<br/>
     Nov 6 - Conference Day 2</p>
             <p>Our <b>call for papers</b> is open until July 2020: <a href="https://cfp.php.ruhr/" target="_blank">https://cfp.php.ruhr/</a><br/>
