     <p>The conference is part of the Dortmund Digital Week #diwodo20 from Nov 2 to 6, 2020, which in 2019 attracted more than 6,500 visitors in total.  For a whole week, there will be lots of talks and workshops on the latest trends and technologies in the field of digitization.</p>
     <p>Join us and visit Dortmund - the city and the surrounding Ruhr area are also known for their numerous tourist attractions.</p>
